# The source package for Debian testing and Ubuntu 26.04. build-deb.sh puts
# this folder in the release tarball's tree as debian/ and builds it there
# (packaging/README.md). Three blocks need a library some distributions do
# not package; each has a build profile that leaves it out, and build-deb.sh
# sets the profile where the library is missing.

